msgstr "Prikaz: @true_label / @false_label"

msgid ""
"See <a href=\"http://php.net/manual/function.date.php\" "
"target=\"_blank\">the documentation for PHP date formats</a>."
msgstr ""
"Pogledajte <a href=\"http://php.net/manual/function.date.php\" "
"target=\"_blank\">dokumentaciju za PHP formate datuma</a>."

msgid "Language list ID"
msgstr "ID liste jezika"

msgid ""
"This site has only a single language enabled. <a "
"href=\":language_url\">Add at least one more language</a> in order to "
"translate content."
msgstr ""
"Ova stranica ima omogućен samo jedan jezik. <a "
"href=\":language_url\">Dodajte najmanje još jedan jezik</a> kako "
"biste mogli prevoditi sadržaj."

msgid ""
"Describe a time by reference to the current day, like '+90 days' (90 "
"days from the day the field is created) or '+1 Saturday' (the next "
"Saturday). See <a "
"href=\"http://php.net/manual/function.strtotime.php\">strtotime</a> "
"for more details."
msgstr ""
"Opišite vrijeme tako što ćete se pozvati na trenutni datum, npr. "
"„+90 dana” (90 dana od dana kada je polje kreirano) ili „+1 "
"subota” (naredna subota). Za više detalja pogledajte <a "
"href=\"http://php.net/manual/function.strtotime.php\">strtotime</a>."

msgid "The type of the log entry, for example \"user\" or \"page not found\"."
msgstr ""
"Tip zapisa u dnevniku, na primjer „korisnik” ili „stranica nije "
"pronađena”."

