msgstr "Status slanja mape sajta (ping protokol)"

msgid ""
"Submission settings can be configured <a "
"href=\"@url\">here</a>.<br/>The ping protocol is <strong>being "
"deprecated</strong>, use IndexNow if applicable."
msgstr ""
"Postavke slanja možete konfigurirati <a "
"href=\"@url\">ovdje</a>.<br/>Ping protokol je <strong>u procesu "
"ukidanja</strong>; ako je primjenjivo, koristite IndexNow."

