msgstr "Status slanja stranice (IndexNow protokol)"

msgid ""
"This enables/disables sitemap submission; don't forget to choose "
"sitemaps below.<br/>The ping protocol is <strong>being "
"deprecated</strong>, use IndexNow if applicable."
msgstr ""
"Ovo omogućava/onemogućava slanje sitemap-ova; ne zaboravite da ispod "
"odaberete sitemap-ove.<br/>Ping protokol je <strong>u procesu "
"depreciranja</strong>, koristite IndexNow ako je primjenjivo."

msgid ""
"Generates URLs from data sets collected in the "
"hook_simple_sitemap_arbitrary_links_alter hook."
msgstr ""
"Generiše URL-ove na osnovu skupova podataka prikupljenih u "
"hook_simple_sitemap_arbitrary_links_alter hook-u."

