"Form is being posted using a custom method. Confirmation page must be "
"handled by the <a href=\":href\">custom form action</a>."
msgstr ""
"Forma se šalje pomoću prilagođene metode. Potvrdnu stranicu mora "
"obraditi <a href=\":href\">prilagođena akcija forme</a>."

